# seo-gsc secrets. Copy to .env.local and fill in. NEVER commit .env.local.
#
# Preferred: a Google service-account JSON key with read-only access to the
# Search Console properties and (optionally) the GA4 properties you list in
# config.yaml. Grant the service-account email "Full" or "Restricted" access in
# Search Console > Settings > Users, and Viewer on the GA4 property.
SEO_GSC_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE=/path/to/seo-gsc-service-account.json

# Alternative: an authorized-user OAuth token JSON (from a one-time consent
# flow). Only one of the two is needed; the service account is preferred for the
# unattended weekly run.
# SEO_GSC_OAUTH_TOKEN_FILE=/path/to/seo-gsc-oauth-token.json
